WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.250
Jamie begins the air approach.

2
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:01.800
OD dive launches Ryu.

3
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.200
Jamie activates Level 1 from the dive launch.

4
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.100
